      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BOLINGBROKE.\nThanks, gentle uncle. Come, lords, away,\nTo fight with Glendower and his complices.\nA while to work, and after holiday.",
